e but this red cage on it  and when we apply these different  stimuli  they will lead to decaging of that  benzoyl guanine and then activation of  the snap receptor signaling  and so  this is where we're headed and i think  it's these types of  advancements that will lead to universal  car t cell therapy being applied to many  more types of cancer and  ultimately  making a dent in the cancer epidemic  and so with that i want to acknowledge  my lab  and everyone who contributed to the  project and our  many collaborators and  our current and past funding support  and also thank you for your attention

